{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1523,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56b0c826c2bb414e3c9ad555",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要组建骑士团，\r\n制服该如何设计呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d97fa6deb62bd9bb90a4f06ff9be437949655358cacd73efda34813beda04ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8817e7a2c303628e7f4f3b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "统一的服装，\r\n确实能让人感受到团结的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b19e77d58bf881ed576f39ed2adc175b47b45478a0b045bb45c37098b018df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62db5a777509ac6aff39a48f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有比这更适合挥舞『圣剑』的衣装了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b16c58a5806953e81747f1c8b97556aa49c6317f632807d9887d63487f4a585",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b44058f0295252cbe66aeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便衣装更替，\r\n我的忠诚依旧不变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45e50fc0378e2cc4816243d82b6fb3aebf962bb5f31ad534aa9c68b28c33284a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ff107ef2caa95dac81a9bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为骑士，\r\n外表也必须得体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "202b0ae6e9a7ad2478c6efd346a1f93a2a3e280ab3f24c8ca424d67c9391faa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a15b63104d5183b8279ac1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6a2f258e82c6b5889c058d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝您安好，我的主君。\r\n愿今日成为令您幸福的一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebd32ce9b725532200a3156a5804e341d6328f807c1e9a6724abc232e398a380",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7dfe0b9625248ab26f25ba3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的早晨，今天有什么计划呢？\r\n无论何时何地，我都会侍奉在您身边，\r\n请安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c86235268eae159014ff2d996cb303f1cf5af667b329cd24d5493ff4d605aefc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:299f7b17e0fd5855c5de458d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，到午餐时间了……\r\n为了挥舞『圣剑』，得先补充能量呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e1c9f71a713a5b694349acd268eecc04625d4857c570897feb414a634fd8c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f2e9453086ec00da08e800",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "金镇之光在取菜的时候，\r\n总是把菜摆成一条直线，\r\n那真是一门技艺啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "654db98b679bee0e533ae19124406d3e2963d621c29a53fff711af9c3d2e941f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca28ef0b6295504955bf61c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了守护您的安眠，\r\n我愿守夜，可您却说不需要……呜呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d07d425a57200db885c6cc27086fe9cd7becc98da2e6ea34a7024fcff52247e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7703acedc64631a705e9bea1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每晚睡前我都会大声重温骑士誓言。\r\n内容？……呵呵，这是秘密哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67d27166142a9145c4a3b10923ac2e8780547c7812591d0435f1c1edcb25e668",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01fb0facafa2d7538606da5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "温柔而包容的力量……\r\n春天是决断的季节，\r\n某种程度上，这也像极了您呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8886a56924e8137a9818fcbaa9920b03262ec08abb4c1d4d481f9a825f54bc13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2361c1fef76f11be9d23fa6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请务必保证水分充足。\r\n若您有什么不测，\r\n我的心定会破碎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51183f82df41326427cf6ab5bcfaaaf257116ba34aae75156d72af6b03d67c47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da52048ce9374ebf2809e36e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "枯叶的声音虽有些悲凉，\r\n但若与您同行，\r\n仿佛也变得像快乐的乐曲一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba0aee3ee9df3b5a7ae119caf5a09bcd13d13bea3b4492f4e96e62af870ceae2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:992b711d69be7bf9c4a410cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了保护您免受寒冷……\r\n是该向『冬将军』发起挑战了吧。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8895aaa47b14a2280a38bf31fa44cdb108b99892339b81776023fc9f79147eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:922679aac7ffdd168bf44dff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03c58166d0f1a332ab18ba20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "信念虽然话不多，\r\n但每一句话都真挚且充满感情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edee40fed5c9ee4530002597fe2d1a6e394ccb39edab6bbfd9f90c5df4dd399f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbc98d64bddb8ea20e6bed81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仅仅最快还不够，\r\n我追求的是锋利无比的剑……\r\n这才是我理想的剑之形态！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f8769aa825b4badde93cc82962aa7bd9b1ebeab05ce654a3549eacf98f30e2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66838272f72087668a092f2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "母亲教给了我许多事情。\r\n比如蹄铁的保养、腿部护理等。\r\n这些都成为了我如今的宝贵财富。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c1a7256c63320684014713a788e76cd25959d1b9be5683a17089bef8d0bc7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaabb0159bf5bdbfff4de68b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我其实很普通，\r\n但我的兄弟姐妹们却都很有个性……\r\n见到他们的话，您一定会吃惊的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb41144e33b8a2b28755337180a7d9d7e765855a5ee5a6ed4131001253f3c734",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e8f4729c9c5b56251a905e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的招式名称……？\r\n若要说的话，或许是天启吧……\r\n只是心中有种无法抑制的呼喊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6dc13f16ac2e78784878359d7f13d6aaaad950e14631762e1afce002503ad95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9c010ae21a71ea52f7f2273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身衣装真是优雅……\r\n我一定要穿得与它相称。",
      "source_fingerprint": "410c71ef196b91e7bee669bacadce88637bde7eb2ee4264be4fbf5bb6a6d8585",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ea2a2f8c210319e34812edc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每样东西都有它的使命，\r\n这件衣装的使命或许就是在舞台上让我们闪耀吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2840b54fcdb00c0a7f31f9b4d2d2177e5ecfe5824e7b4aa71010413f5e4165b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05805b687532af83b1835959",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挺直腰背，堂堂正正。\r\n这是我作为骑士，承载心意的衣装！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2906d98a3af5faf407d9d78d96cfbadad339e542943a4414704cf55bd749bc68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da1821361bb0cfc2a66eacf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然衣装不会改变我的志向，\r\n但却让我更加意识到自己的责任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0f6f22d8b2f7854f49a4f81b9a49ccd89320e77dbe300bd0bd3905b9566dc91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3def2cf67acaed2c33215b7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "金镇之光告诉我整理头发的方法是『啪嗒』，\r\n但这『啪嗒』到底是什么意思呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9b7819d39aa3673c74b82d4de5aa07466a716540ba090ac9bb7f2318b1df18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef2ca3bf428743fb19d3e886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时都要优雅而高贵。\r\n即使肚子饿了，\r\n也不能……咕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2534f4aa96e67992925dae5d95be9552f10074f18a9cb195fbea71c327f569a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baa1b5c5a9b69d5a47bc892c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，接受挑战吧。\r\n我会让我的『圣剑』染上你的血迹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "346f3737307cba748b7833d9fe24f9688dbeec3f38cdaaa2760c2a101b27f23c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d3fa817ec32fc88cf7ce102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的主君，您休息得好吗？\r\n我祈愿您的安康。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a23cd2db079722a8d0c540a391bb7ca186d404479225a7c48ddfa35db2761d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cafb63c5b3c5c24e8e2c3d27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的主君，您的肩上有花瓣……\r\n呵呵，仿佛是您带来了春天呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34d747d0fcd5960f43123b104ef90d66ea3ca182e9106a928d836f176679c946",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09f478785831e2b11a9768a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "照耀大地的夏日阳光，\r\n也会在我『圣剑』的光辉下黯然失色吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63430084380a31570298a63209fd7b38ab0d13072416aad0e5a2590992b8106a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aeb5339b4551a67717a5df6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然是阅读的秋日，\r\n不如向我那做书店店员的父亲问问有什么好书推荐吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb393cc16da0cb28281c27f19126cd62b1cf94c350ce879b4e3c8c5dde6d9eef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:098ecd1e9e054e6850c722bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这干燥的季节，\r\n正如母亲所教导的，\r\n绝不能忽视指甲与皮肤的保养。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e2ba34a9c526d53fc1b2306df52a29e68a8d0401af60826941a17e4b2e3ab15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:275532220ef875c8995098c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然被称为『最快三人组』之一，\r\n但我不会满足于此。\r\n让我们开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "839ba88aa76bf8e6cd9dc2b20914fbb7c299bc50e2210587b6e09db2f203e52b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14f888f762033a3a173ba076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以我的骄傲担保！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba1a43b0b90824bade3d010a7a3675d5779edbfd07c4f3095a8bb09d35e718b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f96c69113346be267ce66b6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了主，为了自己……\r\n努力是骑士应尽之责。\r\n请毫不留情地严格指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f7c8e5c4bbda8f84c6aa5043cbfe0414334c910f3e151ebe2f12dccd2668543",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a76d46842ae22cbcdf494724",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若您感到疲惫，尽管告诉我。\r\n我将背负着您，\r\n继续奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87633d8a859c93c4f4e0662fb969a42172a61b5ddc2a668389d8f5b6bf61fd24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4beb47ad95a841db80c00a53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "骑士的道路虽然艰难，\r\n但我已经准备好面对它了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0947659453ca8d282e12be4f3eb498fd17f11666566a12ba2454930a2a24bb2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a7ee4d5b2e3db7d29e9b30a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "强大源于身心的成长……\r\n我相信，有您在我身边，\r\n我会变得无比强大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b00dcb9bb02d3815f4db5d4b892c1c8bd317bda5340768dfbdb26055a2bd7b3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93cc34ffa2fca6c6f1f82363",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能无畏前行，\r\n不仅因为骑士的誓言，\r\n也因为对您的信任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0620c50e95fb760e7bf8f1cf089f7edd8f8254ea6fe6a508c99c2671b6d81bd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9447a8f24d657ddbc2ec34d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的『圣剑』选择了您，\r\n并指引了我……\r\n这一选择，必定是正确的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d629925f54da5b341ffc1a522186efb18fbe1b7ca5ece902237146e555170f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0414c9ebd213a582e9c067d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏季集训开始了。\r\n放心吧。\r\n我可不是会被炎热击倒的弱者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a089bdf31b2f87e3e2e5855f3841135665b9a9d61ec1df5ceb75906480b7dcef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bba1c1c0e7989d0a17c0d850",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后我仍会忠诚侍奉您，我的主君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "141f1df90782611eb4bfd10d408671c25fd1724de7012d3a9c8e87455590c881",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a4cd7b0f7e6dd7f2e08ba9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能成为您的利剑了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9b8942fb6c73fb1ec739ff4b7d481c31cb385032605fbf7676763acdd0112e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fde6801722a0f50baade3a6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吼啸吧，我的『圣剑』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b41a691a5f6bf8c367711ad52abbb10b19ee4d8144e14cb729752d375302ec2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2e617a4297282364c467a9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "苏醒吧，骑士多旺达……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d890975aadd590add59be8edc7537fc32c37e979f3560c9eb0c90eba53b5dfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3698b2e3089ca63765b05129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我名为多旺达……\r\n是您的骑士，我的主君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "708ba550fa007bf538f27e84b50febda9b85d7fb0ea67f0486ff0baebc87cb48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba56052d5b5738d3115d9e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『圣剑』已经出鞘！\r\n愿荣耀与胜利属于我的主君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b5f3552f4d1cd7214aeff7aac11b8d60f748f4cecf36677a2cd348f913918aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b7bde136240945578898c23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，似乎更锋利了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72e334b61520ac3112d8ba522e5208ad69c3ee4fc314b5a782cb71f9d6968ac4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40979f222669536b6bb3dec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若是吾君的命令——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71cfca610e5c25cbab1e5f1b6337abc72aec4755165c5a07adff41bbbaeeb79b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f6f8e728547d5d769ea905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいレースにしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c9d412c20ebd9938a61fe8a3a721fc218760ab9ca38e63d52111255502b4737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b860a1a8792f0493ccee9cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新人だからとか関係ないよ。\r\nチャンスがあったら踏み込む。\r\n夢は、大きく膨らませてこそだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfaee361becbe736f6526049caa76443da9f348d7efd1141844365d040ff8598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e18c1c7d8d1e3382d61f05d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b0ea50770e74cc57d8f86c94661e324efb2d5121688e3ebb0854357aea8420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b8870552054492a9af667a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11a0208a398fac516fe20c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の走りで勇気が出たなら、\r\nもう心は決まったよね？\r\nさあ、2人で爆風を起こそう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2f739232ea315769c75ef74ca840e0045fa2ad177db7fa4fe13460643e4372",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6e1069e647655cfd209e25e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ありがとう、手を取ってくれて。\r\n本当に綺麗な青だった…宣言する。\r\n『あの光景を、私は一生忘れない』",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cf68b84540867c95116d9166a775fa09044b40644eb0dec750afc99e4a75d6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a83ea76fcb266ad7a3824895",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あけましておめでとう！…って、\r\n1番乗りで言えたかな？貴方に\r\n最初に言うのは私がいいんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8278e8342f8797800fcac9933ac5c0c8c50939d83eb355ffe45aba1295fe122",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:509eccae4ded5da5bd8fc777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、チョコ食べるの\r\n手伝ってくれないかな？\r\nありがたいことに今年も大漁で。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8864c4a525084f099069348d18c4d6667b386f369481b0831ef7643b524848e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b8589a26b1354afd59ee7bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バレンタイン限定のアフタヌーン\r\nティーを予約したんだ。貴方の\r\n笑顔を思い浮かべながら、ね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "760da0f3b42c63bc74edbf76e1c6bfdc007f65c0821d678e1d4522c98d29e5a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3837d8f2943c7d9a2cf168c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "短冊を飾るのも、私からいくよ！\r\n1番最初に飾れば、織姫と彦星の\r\n目にも留まりやすそうじゃない？",
      "source_fingerprint": "78436127051d40de0cec70381d17198378bee8b331c64ef905fa3c776a6da581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab659938cc7eea33c92866a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お菓子くれなきゃこちょこちょだ！\r\nはははっ♪ハロウィンって\r\nカワイイし美味しいし最高だよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51783d2c1fed8593ecb0ed89b57bcb9f85db9efc5d170ef37f8916a8beddff8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7105a7f605d13cd63873581",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年のケーキはどうしようかな？\r\nピンクのハート型…サンタさんの\r\n砂糖菓子が載ってるの…あ～迷う！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7a5aee7d23225f26ddf687b36d28170c41e1e16cbc50dc594761a93177e32e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41bc59628001b7b8740b0cc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスマスは実家のパーティーに\r\n招待してもいい？お世話になってる\r\n貴方を、きちんと紹介したいんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a61fde109f7df10f27ba78908995d1451a0b4a36a4701695b880986dce5022b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aa9a64f73ad401249c9f447",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やった！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ae40f6f63e91a92968c98a815241e460bcbb2177c4eea0e7533c3571dde981",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ef0532e8b6f5a40509afa78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年賀状はもう投函済みなんだ。\r\n絶対に元旦に届けてほしいからね！\r\n新年最初に読んでほしいな♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce620f204d782cf48663d01cce1ba4f40d772e2fc01055676f37482d0a08819e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b83cd5a93f56885380ab34a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日おめでとう！私からは\r\nいちご味のお菓子詰め合わせ！\r\n有名パティスリーのを厳選したよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a829e08778471e8150d345a47f7a065c4ad16e362ccd877bdc6f1d6c6d751d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fba6385f0c5fb8ee27a16801",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "実は…トレーナーさんの誕生祝いに\r\n打ち上げ花火を特注したんだっ！\r\n予定合わせて、鑑賞会しようよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4787b380ebe55109e4a9cbbafe70bf0ce5a8784d1b921f7a4f058bb55043775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43dc7daabccd3fa9ecde269c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふふっ、幼馴染のみんなが\r\nバースデーパーティーを開いて\r\nくれるって！幸せ者だな…私は。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3e6864babfa5374a325259ecd0a1c607d200b81f02cea10bf5d503a441e1548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3138e6ad34d898f8be23a5a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生祝い？じゃあ、ケーキを食べに\r\n行きたいな！貴方と一緒に行きたい\r\nカフェが、たくさんあるんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec88f776a5bd9c996b4c38a0c24805ae2597aaf0146ed79350d8eaada4d820c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31d4c529ae634bfbb803baa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おっ、お知らせが来てるみたいだ。\r\n早くチェックしないとね。\r\n大事な連絡は見逃さないように。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f751b8a5fb99ac7db8e5026d1e27da44bdeeaa9496ad39c337bcdda4c815fb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e84332127212ad32817e252e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントが届いてるってよ！\r\nなんだろう…お菓子とか？\r\nぬいぐるみでも嬉しいな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df70fefe85925117c3bedc90bccd2d91b0a10bddefa99fb8414aa2194d9bb0a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12fe01c34e19bf08422d032f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッションをクリアしたんだね！\r\nさすがトレーナーさん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf33c2297ad71f5a419932cfe76b2723c297caafd6a8370ad69cf660fe17e490",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b511c8fc0b0160e0153fbca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もうすぐイベントをやるみたいだ。\r\n始まったら、1番乗りで楽しもう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "818a51575da267d03c3da97c14c310b24787697ef0aa8a4635ba92a6ad53fd54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ba92288b2424b1e46941e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベント開催中だって。\r\nよし、私が様子を見にいってくる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6708ef49c47606356eed6a9cd967f8c1dd019981b92511d8236ca820d633743e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66bb23d3a7d15a0eed327178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダメか…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f81faf0d1568bba8c9c9e19f39d3972d2660b84e382e80141471e30d108387",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:358419cf8e3b1917381af6aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おお、ウマ娘名鑑が\r\nレベルアップしたみたいだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3a6c5b2a2f2a42e21d488a75073afb0173c8bcb50240347d257bbb9a7ad82d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1271953b5d8b439753a21ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるね…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "420783c210f3a085fb97c19e38a9cc361540883458030aedc806d6d125ce7066",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a96c9ae384f8cca56df834bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私たちの勝ちだね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b930d27ba1a93b865ef52e50c31d3be0a430ef2a33b9b6c5c9433db9972ae40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69f18fd93a97e125301de8aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダメか…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f81faf0d1568bba8c9c9e19f39d3972d2660b84e382e80141471e30d108387",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "1005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
